function normPath(p){p=String(p||'').trim();if(!p)return '';try{if(/^https?:\/\//.test(p))p=new URL(p).pathname+(new URL(p).search||'')}catch(e){}return p.charAt(0)==='/'?p:'/'+p}
V['redirect-new']=function(){return '<div class="s23w">'+topbar('url-redirects','<a data-x="go:content-menus">Menus</a> / <a data-x="go:url-redirects">URL redirects</a>')+'<div class="s23hd"><h1>URL redirect</h1></div><div class="c26two"><div><b>Redirect from</b><p class="s23mut">The original URL that you’d like to forward visitors from. Usually, this is an old page the visitors can no longer access because the content was moved to a different URL or deleted.</p></div>'+card('','<label class="s23lb" for="c26rf">Redirect from</label><input class="s23in" id="c26rf" placeholder="e.g. /shop/shoes">')+'<div><b>Redirect to</b><p class="s23mut">The new URL that visitors should be forwarded to. If you want to redirect to your store’s homepage, enter / (a forward slash).</p></div>'+card('','<label class="s23lb" for="c26rt">Redirect to</label><input class="s23in" id="c26rt" placeholder="Type or paste a link">')+'</div><div style="text-align:right"><button class="btn pri" data-x="c26rsave" id="c26rsave">Save redirect</button></div><p id="c26rerr" class="pf-err"></p></div>'};
